{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08、S11等短停留段落仍有较多未标时出现的感受，观众未必来得及扫完；X的左右并列短词在这些地方更利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮的关键词让观众更快抓住人物每一阶段的核心变化，感受又能随着音乐分时出现，因此人物的矛盾、反复和逐渐作出决定的过程更容易被理解。尤其是从怀念亲近、害怕孤单，到不愿再忍受委屈、决定带着想念继续生活，前后因果比X更清楚；音乐感受也更有具体的身体反应、音型和情绪转折，而不只是情绪名称。X的短词并列有扫读优势，但不少段落的感受缺少时间和发展顺序，细腻程度与叙事连贯性不及Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a1b26977-6e9f-4021-a30e-d0dc33ed1a3b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002230425538Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:23:34.573682+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4ff09e2f9bfcdd879c160209072b37da58e07821642e0cd3c924dfb1df6ef5ac", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c